        "r": 262.97999999999996,
        "b": 206.60234000000003
      },
      "content": "Remove the cartridge door assembly."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1335",
      "reading_order": 1713,
      "section": "Post service test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.0,
        "t": 194.69233999999994,
        "r": 477.43,
        "b": 183.1023399999999
      },
      "content": "NOTE: If the toner cartridge was not removed prior to servicing the printer, remove it now."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1336",
      "reading_order": 1714,
      "section": "Post service test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.0,
        "t": 172.19233999999994,
        "r": 512.1700000000005,
        "b": 160.60234000000003
      },
      "content": "Release the support shaft (callout 1), and then slide it toward the center of the door (callout 2)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1337",
      "reading_order": 1715,
      "section": "Post service test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 135.0,
        "t": 148.69233999999994,
        "r": 500.31,
        "b": 137.1023399999999
      },
      "content": "TIP: It might be easier to release the support shaft by using a small flat-blade screwdriver ."
